# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                    .gitignore — FUND TRANSFER                       ║
# ║                                                                      ║
# ║  Stack : Spring Boot, Maven, Java, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Redis      ║
# ║  IDE   : IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code, Eclipse                            ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECRETS & ENVIRONMENT — NEVER COMMIT THESE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# environment variable files — contain DB passwords, JWT secrets, API keys
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.dev
.env.prod
.env.staging

# production properties — contain real credentials
application-prod.properties
application-prod.yml
application-staging.properties
application-staging.yml

# SSL/TLS certificates and keys
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.truststore
certs/
ssl/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# JAVA — COMPILED OUTPUT
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# compiled class files
*.class

# JAR, WAR, EAR archives
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar

# java crash logs
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MAVEN — BUILD OUTPUT
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# build output folder — contains compiled code and JARs
target/

# maven wrapper jar — download automatically on first run
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# maven local repo cache (when embedded)
.mvn/repository/

# release backup files
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.next
release.properties
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
buildNumber.properties

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LOGS — NEVER COMMIT LOG FILES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# all log files in any folder
logs/
*.log
*.log.*

# rolling log archives
*.log.gz
*.log.zip

# service-specific log folders
api-gateway/logs/
user-service/logs/
bank-service/logs/
discovery-service/logs/

# spring boot log files
spring.log

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# INTELLIJ IDEA
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# IntelliJ project files — IDE-specific, not needed by others
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

# IntelliJ shelf (uncommitted change stash)
.idea/shelf/

# IntelliJ workspace (personal IDE layout)
.idea/workspace.xml

# IntelliJ task manager
.idea/tasks.xml

# IntelliJ dictionaries
.idea/dictionaries/

# IntelliJ usage statistics
.idea/usage.statistics.xml

# IntelliJ run configurations — keep only shared ones
# .idea/runConfigurations/   ← uncomment to ignore run configs too

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VS CODE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# VS Code workspace settings — personal preferences
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ECLIPSE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Eclipse project files
.classpath
.project
.settings/
.factorypath
bin/

# Eclipse build output
/bin/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SPRING BOOT — SPECIFIC FILES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# spring boot devtools restart trigger file
.reloadtrigger

# spring boot fat jar layers (docker build artifacts)
**/layers.idx
**/classpath.idx

# spring boot buildinfo (generated at build time)
**/build-info.properties

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DATABASE — LOCAL DATA
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# PostgreSQL local data dump
*.sql.backup
*.dump
*.pgdump
pgdata/

# H2 embedded database files (if used in tests)
*.db
*.mv.db
*.trace.db

# Liquibase generated files
liquibase.properties

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DOCKER
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# docker environment override files — contain local credentials
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.local.yml
docker-compose.prod.yml

# docker volumes (local data)
docker/volumes/
docker/data/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPERATING SYSTEM
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# Linux
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TEST OUTPUT
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# test reports generated by Maven Surefire
**/surefire-reports/

# test coverage reports (JaCoCo)
**/jacoco.exec
**/jacoco/

# Allure test reports
allure-results/
allure-report/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TEMPORARY FILES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# temp files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# backup files
*.bak
*.backup
*.orig

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROTOBUF — gRPC GENERATED CODE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# protobuf generated Java files — auto-generated from .proto files
# generated/
# **/generated-sources/protobuf/

# ✅ keep .proto source files — commit these
# ❌ do not commit generated Java code from .proto

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NODE / FRONTEND (if any frontend module exists)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm
.yarn
dist/
build/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MONITORING / OBSERVABILITY
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Prometheus local data
prometheus/data/

# Grafana local data
grafana/data/

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# KEEP THESE — FORCE INCLUDE IMPORTANT FILES
# (overrides any above rules)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ✅ keep maven wrapper scripts — needed to build without Maven installed
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties
!mvnw
!mvnw.cmd

# ✅ keep dev/test application properties — no real credentials
!application.properties
!application.yml
!application-dev.properties
!application-dev.yml
!application-test.properties
!application-test.yml

# ✅ keep Liquibase changelog files — these are migration scripts
!**/db/changelog/**

# ✅ keep .proto files — gRPC service definitions
!**/*.proto

# ✅ keep Dockerfile — needed for deployment
!Dockerfile
!docker-compose.yml
```

---

## Put it in Root of Your Project
```
fund-transfer/          ← root
├── .gitignore          ← here
├── api-gateway/
├── user-service/
├── bank-service/
├── discovery-service/
└── pom.xml